SkyrimDevtools licensing

MIT covers the Python client, Windows launcher, native transport, build scripts
and tests. See licenses/MIT.txt.

The extension header ext/skyrim_devtools_ext.h and the example plugin source in examples/ are MIT, so a plugin that
only includes the header takes on no GPL obligation from this project.

The Windows plugin adapter, native/plugin.cpp, carries GPL-3.0-or-later. See
licenses/CommonLibSSE-GPL-3.0.txt and the pinned CommonLibSSE-NG notices and
linking exceptions in README.md.

Project documentation is dedicated under CC0 1.0 Universal. See
licenses/CC0-1.0.txt.

Third-party dependencies retain their licenses. Skyrim and related game assets
and trademarks are the property of their respective owners.
